  "description": "PAJHUF crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C108 H168 Gd4 O18,C6 H14. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd1B (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2B (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.512-4.014 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.00-115.11°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C108H168Gd4O18·C6H14.",
